   "source": [
    "# UTTA-Med: Multi-Seed Authoritative Experiment — Seed 123\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook executes the frozen authoritative experimental pipeline for **Seed 123** on Camelyon17-WILDS:\n",
    "1. **Step 1**: Freeze Seed-42 configuration (`configs/authoritative_resnet18_utta.yaml`)\n",
    "2. **Step 2**: Verify the 5 protocol guardrails (BN affine update scope, frozen BN running statistics, zero target label leakage, Center-1 threshold isolation, reproducible random gate)\n",
    "3. **Step 3**: Execute full end-to-end pipeline:\n",
    "   - Source training on Centers `{0, 3, 4}` with early stopping on Center `{1}`\n",
    "   - Best checkpoint restoration from peak Center-1 AUROC\n",
    "   - Source-only evaluation on Center 1 (val) and Center 2 (test)\n",
    "   - MC-Dropout epistemic uncertainty analysis on Center 1 ($N=20$ passes)\n",
    "   - UTTA threshold selection at 70th percentile of predictive variance\n",
    "   - Calibrate matched-coverage control thresholds on Center 1 (Random, Confidence, Entropy)\n",
    "   - Continual adaptation on unlabeled Center 2 stream: **Tent**, **EATA**, **Random**, **Confidence**, **Entropy**, **UTTA-Med**\n",
    "   - Single final evaluation on Center 2 held-out labels with flip table analysis\n",
    "4. **Step 4**: Save authoritative results to `results/metrics/camelyon17_resnet18_utta_gated_s123.json`"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. GPU Environment Verification"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
